{"id":"145fee39d6716fb8","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-principal-function.md","title":"无限集合的主函数","display":"df-principal-function — 无限集合的主函数","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-principal-function","aliases":["20-df-principal-function"],"display":"df-principal-function — 无限集合的主函数","chapter":"5","section":"5.3","source_kind":"book","verification_status":"reviewed","source_reference":"Definition 5.3.2；主函数记号的展开","source_pdf_pages":[149],"source_printed_pages":[114],"depends_on":[]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-principal-function"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-principal-function</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-principal-function — 无限集合的主函数"},{"key":"chapter","html":"5"},{"key":"section","html":"5.3"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Definition 5.3.2；主函数记号的展开"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>149</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>114</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(B\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|B|=\\omega\">\\(|B|=\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}principal\\text{-}function}\\vdash\np_B(n):=\\mu x\\ [|B\\cap\\{0,\\ldots,x\\}|=n+1].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}principal\\text{-}function}\\vdash\np_B(n):=\\mu x\\ [|B\\cap\\{0,\\ldots,x\\}|=n+1].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p_B(n)\">\\(p_B(n)\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 的第 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n+1\">\\(n+1\\)</span> 小成员。无限性保证全定义；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p_B\">\\(p_B\\)</span> 由 oracle <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 计算，但通常不能普通计算。</p>\n<p>来源：Definition 5.3.2；主函数记号的展开；印刷页 114；PDF 第 149 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"B\\subseteq\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"|B|=\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}principal\\text{-}function}\\vdash\np_B(n):=\\mu x\\ [|B\\cap\\{0,\\ldots,x\\}|=n+1].","display":true},{"tex":"p_B(n)","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"n+1","display":false},{"tex":"p_B","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false}],"bytes":951,"backlinks":[{"id":"c8d70fc96898bee6","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-principal-function]]；see [[20-df-characteristic]]；see [[20-df-oracle-numbering]]。"},{"id":"f222b74804c56f9b","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-deficiency]]；see [[20-df-hypersimple]]；see [[20-df-truth-table]]；see [[20-df-principal-function]]；see [[20-thm-hyperimmune-bound]]。"},{"id":"680f7bcce5dddc10","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-hyperimmune]]；see [[20-df-principal-function]]；see [[20-df-domination]]；see [[20-df-computabl